  <item>
    <title>E45 单亲妈妈生存指南：少听“大爱无疆”，多问“能打钱吗？”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa0f84530dee5c2474b9a10</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa0f84530dee5c2474b9a10</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 06:23:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听户好！今天我们请来了一位新嘉宾刺猬来聊聊她奇妙的单身带娃经历～</span></p><p><span>Enjoy～</span></p><p><span>以下是时间轴：</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> 啥叫“完整家庭”？没爹没妈难道就不配当个正常人了？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a></span></strong><span> 儿子在学校被霸凌，对方居然拿“你是单亲”当拿捏他的筹码！</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a></span></strong><span> 对方家长直接秀下限：“我们家可没见识过离异家庭”……</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a></span></strong><span> 孩子想当“大哥”，家长负责递刀：恶这玩意儿还真是“一脉相承”。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a></span></strong><span> 离婚后不撕逼，我和前夫没话讲，但不耽误他当个爹。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a></span></strong><span> 以前的电视里为啥总把单亲小孩叫“野种”？说白了就是父权社会在作祟。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a></span></strong><span> 离异男带娃是“有责任感”，离异女带娃就成了“打折处理”？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></strong><span> 少拿“大爱”俯瞰我！想关心我？麻烦先微信转账发个红包。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a></span></strong><span> 一回娘家，七大姑八大姨全抢着当“爹”，上赶着教我怎么当妈。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a></span></strong><span> 刚离婚就有异性来开黄腔？不好意思，没带老婆的约会概不奉陪。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a></span></strong><span> 闻到离婚的气味就来发脑残祝福？这种同学不删留着过年？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2452">40:52</a></span></strong><span> 儿子未来的规划里没有我？太好了，老娘终于自由了！</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a></span></strong><span> 小地方的离婚惨剧：哥姐全员化身“教导主任”，给妈发个红包都被骂。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a></span></strong><span> 结婚是“找人还债”，不婚是“受过伤”——反正横竖都是离异女有病！</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a></span></strong><span> 疫情被封控，儿子在线求妈：“给我找个能陪我打游戏的新爸爸吧”！</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660bc67a1519139e4f2282cd/lncuJ_5ENQJkr11J2nmdw-y2dzKP.m4a" length="65294769" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDb-F6qk4UR9pYmefaKbwGaKtzy.jpeg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E44 野鸟被投喂驯化，忠犬被铁链拴死，人类依然是世界的主人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a70914d1b5e24969ce846e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a70914d1b5e24969ce846e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:17:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>纯爱战神小叶从肯尼亚回来了，顺着她的见闻我们来谈谈人与自然。</span></p><p><span>以下是时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 大鸟硬抢盒饭，鱼鹰被喂成废柴，越野车一轰直接把母狮的饭碗给吵翻了。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 有冰岛船长熄火关照海豹，也有瞎喂面包把鸟羽毛都喂烂了，劝两句还挨一顿喷。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 动物撑得直吐还在硬塞，说白了花钱投喂根本不是爱，就是图自己花钱“听个响”。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 赶海抓虫美其名曰亲近自然，最离谱的是西湖边居然有人想把小鸳鸯给遛回家……</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 铁链锁狗一辈子、封洞虐杀老鼠、分享救助眼疾狗狗的十年，拉回点人间温暖。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 为了干饭杀生算自然规律，为了流量虐杀就是有病，哪怕拍死个蚊子也得抱个歉。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 别动不动就踩流浪动物，直接怼死“你觉得可怜你怎么不全抱回家”的杠精。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 靠嘴巴劝根本没用，赶紧给养宠物立法，弃养的就得狠狠罚！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 光看热闹不够，普通人拿起手机和麦克风，也能帮野生动物喊两句。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 别搞得地球好像人类开的一样，收收高高在上的劲儿，学会和动物平起平坐。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660bc67a1519139e4f2282cd/lvdoYo4TJ7mawteHac3Z0fAyVyPA.m4a" length="63505108" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpfy51FJQBSrCIm9-mljUfybUxQ5.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E43 所谓的“中年叛逆”，不过是一场迟到的找回自我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a611834a3fec224d5a1d1ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a611834a3fec224d5a1d1ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 20:08:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是否也在某一天突然发现，自己一直在为了满足父母的期待、社会的规则而“循规蹈矩”地生活？甚至习惯了去“善解别人的意”，却从未“解过自己的意”？</span></p><p><span>本期节目，主播马鹿邀请到了经历“中年觉醒”的嘉宾拿铁。在长达十几年的东亚亲子关系压抑与无休止的“牺牲奉献式”爱意绑架后，拿铁经历了情绪的彻底崩溃，最终决定拉开与父母的界限，开启了一场看似跳脱、实则通透的“中年叛逆”。从冲向追星现场体验久违的生命热烈，到拒绝无效社交、重新找回内心的悦己方式——叛逆从来不是为了反抗而反抗，而是找回那个被框架困住的鲜活自我。</span></p><p><span>如果你也正处于窒息的亲密关系中，或是感到身心俱疲、找不到生活的掌控感，不妨听听这场关于界限、觉醒与自我救赎的真诚对话。</span></p><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a></span></strong><span> ｜什么是“中年叛逆”？突然打耳钉、骑摩托、染黄毛背后的真相。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>思想的转向</span></strong><span>：从“考虑客观因素与他人感受”到“我喜不喜欢、愿不愿意”。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>像在模具里长大的西瓜</span></strong><span>：从小被夸“乖”背后是自我意识的压抑，反抗不等于坏孩子。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>窒息的母女关系</span></strong><span>：缺乏界限感、连轴转的电话，与被迫承担“老公/父母”角色的女儿。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>29岁一夜长大</span></strong><span>：父亲生病，被迫透支12年成为家庭顶梁柱，直到情绪彻底崩溃。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>东亚式家庭的怪圈</span></strong><span>：“砸锅卖铁”的亏欠感灌输，与纯牺牲奉献式爱的精神枷锁。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>付出的期望与回报</span></strong><span>：父母过度付出带来的控制欲，以及如何下定决心确立界限。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>拉扯与突破</span></strong><span>：如何建立健康的界限？为什么上一代人对“界限感”如此陌生？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3183">53:03</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3617">60:17</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>性别的困境</span></strong><span>：对女孩的捆绑保护 vs 对男孩的无脑包办（妈宝男的诞生）。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3679">61:19</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4610">76:50</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>离谱却浪漫的追星记</span></strong><span>：用AI筛地址、地铁转线抓通告，跳出舒适区体验“纯粹的热烈”。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4610">76:50</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4869">81:09</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>风吹在身上的温度</span></strong><span>：追星不是目的，是唤醒感官、拥抱生命热烈的引子。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4935">82:15</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5170">86:10</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>拒做“好人”</span></strong><span>：“心重”与善解人意的规训，学会立一个“不好惹”的人设保护自己。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5183">86:23</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5408">90:08</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>做回自己</span></strong><span>：减少无效社交，重启阅读与写作，寻找由内而外的悦己。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5430">90:30</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5661">94:21</a></span></strong><span> ｜ </span><strong><span>结语与建议</span></strong><span>：叛逆没有标准模板，鼓励大家及时寻求专业帮助、勇敢找回活人感</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
