  <item>
    <title>E40 当北美“精英虎妈”输给“自闭症”儿子，竟赢得了整个人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cfc799e2c8be3155515928</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cfc799e2c8be3155515928</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 14:06:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期，我们请到了重磅嘉宾—— Annie，硬币的一面，她是从北京到香港再到美国定居的出身于顶级名校世家的精英；硬币的另一面，她有一个被诊断为“自闭症”的儿子。</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a></span></strong><span> | 最初的“虎妈”剧本：曾试图用手语和体操精准控制孩子的每一个成长节点。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a></span></strong><span> | 觉醒时刻：意识到“教育”的初衷往往是为了大人的面子，而非孩子的需要。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a></span></strong><span> | 命运的重击：确诊二胎儿子患有严重自闭症，从愤怒、否认到最终的臣服。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a></span></strong><span> | 夫妻认知的博弈：坦诚男性与女性在面对孩子缺陷时不同的心理恢复周期。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a></span></strong><span> | 姐弟关系的厚度：19 岁女儿选择“Gap Year”陪伴家人，苦难中长出的同理心。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a></span></strong><span> | 重新定义“沟通”：即便没有言语，如何透过眼神与那个“困住的灵魂”达成深度连接。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a></span></strong><span> | 关于“有用”的哲学思辨：如果孩子注定无法对社会产生“贡献”，他的生命价值何在？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3735">62:15</a></span></strong><span> | 焦虑的镜像效应：父母的情绪才是孩子最真实的“成长环境”。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">68:40</a></span></strong><span> | 禁忌话题：直面“如果我先走了，孩子怎么办”的终极恐惧。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4400">73:20</a></span></strong><span> | 心理建设的转变：从试图“预定未来”到全然地“活在当下这一秒”。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4785">79:45</a></span></strong><span> | 结尾寄语：苦难不是为了让人悲惨，而是为了让人变得更深刻且温柔。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4982">83:02</a></span></strong><span> | 节目谢幕：生命中最重要的能力，是与“不完美”和平共处。</span></p></li></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660bc67a1519139e4f2282cd/lgrTJCpgJ9KKyb6k4wDAeD0_O6og.m4a" length="77887639" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMJ90lZoUJ-Ngb97_-qFkRVJAm3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E39 清明为啥要烧纸：中国丧葬习俗的千年演变【清明特辑】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c9686eb977fb2c478ee7fb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c9686eb977fb2c478ee7fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 19:42:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>清明特辑来啦～为什么我们要烧纸钱：从最新款的iPhone到各种数码产品，甚至不知道AI出来后会不会还要烧个“数字人”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但聊着聊着我们发现：这些看似迷信的仪式，其实藏着中国人数千年的生死观。</span><br><span>为什么商代人人殉？为什么汉代人要穿金缕玉衣，甚至把生前的豪宅、车马、甚至厕所都搬进墓里？为什么曹操要提倡薄葬，而唐代的陶俑却都在“开派对”？为什么到了宋代，大家突然开始流行烧纸扎了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，我们透过博物馆里的文物，穿越回上古、商周、汉唐与宋明清，揭秘</span><strong><span>殷墟里的“铅中毒”猜想</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>刘备老祖宗中山靖王的奢华墓葬</span></strong><span>，以及</span><strong><span>唐代陶俑为何个个笑容满面</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>关键时间点</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>清明特别企划：</span></strong><span> 从烧iPhone到冥界百货，聊聊丧葬习俗的由来</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>上古时期：</span></strong><span> 朴素生死观，“厚衣以薪，葬之中野”</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>商代：</span></strong><span> 鬼神崇拜</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;殉人与车马坑，让服务团队去阴间继续伺候</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a></span></strong><span> 海贝入殓，自古“有钱能使鬼推磨”的习俗</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a></span></strong><span> 🏛️ </span><strong><span>周代：</span></strong><span> “事死如生”观念萌芽，周公制礼作乐</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>进步与替代：</span></strong><span> 陶俑（明器）出现，用象征品代替活人殉葬</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>汉代革命：</span></strong><span> 墓室变成“阴间住宅”，视死如视生的巅峰</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>汉代礼制：</span></strong><span> 完善的丧葬流程与“五服制度”，孝道被量化</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>国宝金缕玉衣：</span></strong><span> 中山靖王刘胜墓，防腐与通灵的执念</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>魏晋变革：</span></strong><span> 曹操父子提倡薄葬，因为“厚葬是给盗墓贼发请帖”</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>曹丕的清醒：</span></strong><span> “未有不亡之国，亦无不绝之墓”，薄葬保平安</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>陶俑转型：</span></strong><span> 从实物转向象征，陶俑艺术开始流行</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>南北朝：</span></strong><span> 门阀士族与职业哭丧，“孝”变成了一种政治表演</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>唐代巅峰：</span></strong><span> 唐三彩与载乐骆驼俑，死亡不再恐怖，而是“开派对”</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2939">48:59</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>时代气质：</span></strong><span> 为什么唐代陶俑都在笑？从肃穆到世俗化的转变</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2997">49:57</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>宋代转折：</span></strong><span> 火葬流行与纸扎的普及，烧纸钱习俗的真正起源</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3167">52:47</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>纸钱经济学：</span></strong><span> 为什么从真钱变成纸钱？因为便宜、方便且不占地</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3366">56:06</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>明清固化：</span></strong><span> 朱元璋重定五服，礼制顶峰与民间形式主义</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3469">57:49</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>演变总结：</span></strong><span> 从“埋真货”到“烧纸扎”，仪式感大于物质</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3512">58:32</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>结语：</span></strong><span> 丧葬习俗的演变，其实是回归情感需求与对生命的告别</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660bc67a1519139e4f2282cd/lsmOZrlhAaEY6bWji5BRZxkIekJl.m4a" length="59547579" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:22</itunes:duration>
