  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E38 年货零食分享（下）：把全世界的“福气”都搬回家</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b3818584bce022f93c4d82</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b3818584bce022f93c4d82</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 03:27:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>麦麦提到的2元一张店主就觉得赚很多的蔚县手工剪纸：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpQomtkJbBBnYkb7aa-a0hwz2YQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgi9zI3W2bXYdIaWvRw9P75FOzGa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>当扑令提到的“乳茄”：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqeRiUpy3g5ETHabXpUnELWl2Ozn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>当扑令提到的Ikea的糖葫芦筷子：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkK8LdxGVEmysGjXGiwU_Zmk2_PU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> 祥龙抬头：年货大集开市啦！</span></strong><span>接上期美食话题，今天咱们把压箱底的年货宝贝全掏出来。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 塑料浪漫：乐高年宵花，永不凋谢的福气</span></strong><span>谁说塑料没灵魂？柿子、银柳、兰花，不用浇水不招虫，是最体面的“懒人年味”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 拼的是耐心，治的是浮躁：全家总动员拼乐高</span></strong><span>看老爸老妈放下手机钻研图纸，这不仅是拼积木，更是全家消磨时光的最高级仪式感。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 黄金果与朱顶红：让客厅瞬间变身“植物园”</span></strong><span>南方金桔，北方水仙。那个长得像“大白”又像小手的黄金果，寓意五代同堂，简直是年花界的卖萌担当。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 满满当当才是年：这该死的囤货安全感</span></strong><span>为什么过年非得买到冰箱塞不下？因为那份“溢出来”的热闹，就是咱老百姓心底的踏实。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 蔚县剪纸：藏在数学作业本里的非遗浪漫</span></strong><span>跨越千里的手艺，带着泥土的芬芳和刀刻的倔强。两块钱买到的不仅是窗花，更是手艺人的心跳。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 跨越国界的美：从尼日利亚到蔚县的匠心</span></strong><span>聊聊手工艺的商业化，虽然有苦涩，但那些带有“体温”的年货，永远比流水线更有力量。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> 春联里的讲究：甲方老爸的“金色审美”</span></strong><span>春联不能太宽，字千万别带黑。满眼金灿灿，求的就是一个红红火火、万事如意。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a> 本命年大作战：红袜子、红对联，精神气儿拉满</span></strong><span>不管是求个心安还是图个喜庆，本命年的那一抹红，就是咱们对抗生活的小确幸。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 年货压轴：从茶饮到“牛脆脆”，</span></strong><span>百香果干、枸杞茶。喝的是味道，品的是生活。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> 尾声：茶香满屋，愿你年年岁岁常欢愉</span></strong><span>最后推荐这口清茶，洗去一年的疲惫。祝大家兜里有钱，手里的年货最甜！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660bc67a1519139e4f2282cd/llCSgSnvzoxREOWFupVsWzWoDXtE.m4a" length="59808776" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqF752IOUhYwrSJ-zU-1xQvXeM9g.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
